#: src/components/MotionControls.js:24
msgid "Hover Interaction Type"
msgstr ""

#: src/blocks/kinetic-box/index.js:411
msgid "What the box does while the pointer is over it. Lift raises it, Scale grows it slightly, Tilt rotates it on both axes. Effect Intensity below drives whichever one is chosen."
msgstr ""

