msgid "Enable Glassmorphism"
msgstr ""

#: src/blocks/kinetic-box/index.js:509
msgid "Replaces the background of the box with a translucent white layer and blurs whatever shows through it. The two settings that appear below set how opaque that layer is and how strong the blur is."
