#: src/blocks/kinetic-image-hero/index.js:1138
msgid "Rotation (°)"
msgstr ""

#: src/blocks/kinetic-image-hero/index.js:1138
msgid "Turns the images in opposite directions. The value is the strongest turn; the other images turn less, and Offset Duo keeps its primary image straight. 0 keeps everything straight. Mobile uses half, or none when the images stack."
